==Strategy==
This stage throws multiple Capies, albeit with delays, so spamming meatshields here is a must. With a quartet of boosted Shy Boys, [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] are necessary to finish them off as quickly as possible. Specific recommendations include [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bathtub Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], and [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Cutter Cat]] all work, among others.

